00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.240
She's an author.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:57.520
She's a speaker.

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:02.800
I love that you, one, dealer of hope.

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:06.240
And I love the loudness that you bring.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:10.360
