So can you first talk about, all caps, hope dealer,

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:23.840
what does that mean to you?

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:28.000
You know, I think that life is so hard,

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.320
that you need some people in your life that

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:32.960
just aren't trouble, people that don't

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:35.000
suck the life out of you.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.120
And that's what I am, man.

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:41.040
I think that for so long, I depended on people.

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.280
I depended on relationships.

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:46.720
I depended on my dream board getting accomplished,

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:50.280
expectations that I had for my life at a certain age

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:51.280
to happen.

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:54.480
And when they didn't, I found myself in depression.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:57.120
Following through with this, man, the society

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:58.720
told me I should be here.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.520
And here I am just flopping at life.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:04.600
And man, when I was about 36, 37 years old, man,

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.040
I had an epiphany.

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:07.480
I walked through something in my life

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:09.920
