00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:37.280
and I did it for two years

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:40.800
and when God started opening up major platforms for me,

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:43.640
I mean, man, in the last, so I thought at 36 years old,

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:47.840
my life was over, Evan, at 41 years old

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:49.720
is when I got to go full-time ministry

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:52.960
because I had a video go viral, go figure

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:57.960
and 42, I wrote my very first book with my special Ed self

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:02.920
