00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:05.120
and at 47, which I am today,

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.880
I realized my life is just beginning

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.560
and so that's why I'm a hope dealer, man,

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.440
if God can do it for me, can do it for you,

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:13.760
all you gotta do is believe in yourself

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.720
and just put yourself out there.

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:17.920
I love it, she's preaching,

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:20.880
she's preaching right here on Instagram, I love it.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:25.360
While you were talking, people were talking in the chat too

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:30.400
